es > div:hover { transform: translateY(-2px); box-shadow: 0 10px 24px rgba(102,126,234,0.3); border-color: rgba(102,126,234,0.5); background: rgba(50,50,60,0.9); } .kpi.tiles h3 { margin: 0 0 6px 0; font-weight: 800; color: #ffffff !important; text-align: center; } .kpi.tiles p { margin: 0; color: #ffffff !important; text-align: center; width: 100%; } .hr-fancy { height: 3px; border: none; background: linear-gradient(to right, #667eea, #764ba2); border-radius: 3px; margin: 22px 0; } .section-hero > :first-child { margin-top: 0; } .section-hero > :last-child { margin-bottom: 0; } @media (max-width: 520px) { .overview-emoji { width: 34px; height: 34px; font-size: 18px; } .overview-title { font-size: 20px; } } </style> <div class=\"section-hero\"> <div class=\"overview-head\"> <span class=\"overview-emoji\">1</span> <h2 class=\"overview-title\" id=\"overview\">Project Overview</h2> </div> <div class=\"callout pretty\"> The <b>AgriVision-Gemma3n</b> project aims to create a powerful, offline-capable multimodal AI assistant for farmers. The model is designed to diagnose crop diseases from images and provide actionable advice, accessible on mobile devices without an internet connection. <br><br> This notebook demonstrates the capabilities of the final merged model. The model was developed through a sequential fine-tuning process: <ol> <li>First, the Gemma3n-e2b-it model was fine-tuned on the comprehensive <b>CDDM-bench dataset</b>.</li> <li>Then, the resulting adapter was further fine-tuned on the conversational <b>6k Agri-LLaVA instruction dataset</b> to enhance its interactive abilities.</li> </ol> </div> <div class=\"kpi tiles\"> <div> <h3>🧠 Base</h3> <p>unsloth/gemma-3n-e2b-it-unsloth-bnb-4bit</p> </div> <div> <h3>📚 Data</h3> <p>CDDM-bench → Agri-LLaVA 6k Chat</p> </div> <div> <h3>🚀 Output</h3> <p>AgriVision-gemma3n (Merged Model)</p> </div> <div> <h3>🎯 Goal</h3> <p>Offline Farmer Assistant App</p> </div> </div> </div>\n"},"metadata":{}}],"execution_count":3},{"cell_t